## BUNHS School System - Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` (local) or set these as Railway project variables.

## ============================================================
# BUNHS SCHOOL SYSTEM - ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ============================================================

# Database Configuration (Railway)
DB_HOST=${RAILWAY_PRIVATE_DOMAIN}
DB_USER=${MYSQLUSER}
DB_PASSWORD=${MYSQLPASSWORD}
DB_NAME=${MYSQLDATABASE}
DB_PORT=${MYSQLPORT}

# Database Configuration (Local Development - Uncomment for local testing)
# DB_HOST=localhost
# DB_USER=root
# DB_PASSWORD=
# DB_NAME=bunhs_db_important
# DB_PORT=3306

# Application Configuration
APP_ENV=production
APP_DEBUG=false
APP_URL=${RAILWAY_PUBLIC_DOMAIN}

# Security Configuration
JWT_SECRET=${JWT_SECRET:-your-secret-key-here}
CSRF_SECRET=${CSRF_SECRET:-your-csrf-secret-here}

# Email Configuration (Optional)
MAIL_HOST=${MAIL_HOST:-smtp.gmail.com}
MAIL_PORT=${MAIL_PORT:-587}
MAIL_USER=${MAIL_USER:-your-email@gmail.com}
MAIL_PASSWORD=${MAIL_PASSWORD:-your-app-password}
MAIL_ENCRYPTION=${MAIL_ENCRYPTION:-tls}

# File Upload Configuration
MAX_FILE_SIZE=${MAX_FILE_SIZE:-5242880}
UPLOAD_PATH=${UPLOAD_PATH:-uploads/}

# Session Configuration
SESSION_LIFETIME=${SESSION_LIFETIME:-7200}
SESSION_PATH=${SESSION_PATH:-/tmp}

# Railway Specific
PORT=${PORT:-8080}
RAILWAY_ENVIRONMENT=production
APP_DEBUG=false
CACHE_TTL_STATS=300
CACHE_TTL_CREDENTIALS=3600

## Railway Setup Instructions:
1. Railway Dashboard → Your Project → Variables tab
2. Add each DB_* variable from your MySQL addon's connection details
3. Click "Deploy" or run `railway up`
4. View logs: Should show "mysqli" in php -m output
5. Test: Visit deployed URL → see homepage stats (confirms DB connection)
